Title:  Filtered Search Results

Request Date: 2026-07-21

Link:   https://discourse.notenik.app/t/a-search-filter-bar-above-the-list/884?u=hbowie

Body:

A function that I would really love to see would be a search bar at the top of the list which would filter the list to include only notes that contained the text in the search bar.

The search would include all text in any note, including any field values, names or tags. But this would be mainly for text in the body of the note.

Any notes not containing the search term would be hidden. Would this be possible?
